        "we can['’]?t wait to (see|welcome|meet|hear)",
        "(we['’]re|i['’]?m) (so |very |truly )?(excited|thrilled|delighted|pleased) to (announce|share|invite|introduce|welcome)",
        "(we|i) am (so |very |truly )?(excited|thrilled|delighted|pleased) to (announce|share|invite|introduce|welcome)",
        "warm(ly)? (welcome|invitation)",
        "heartfelt",
        "(we['’]re|i['’]?m) (so |truly |incredibly )?(grateful|thankful|proud)",
        "(i|we) (am|are) (so |truly |incredibly )?(grateful|thankful|proud)",
